background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">购票请扫下方二维码</span></strong></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 1em; word-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: center;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201808/Fo7XAXXPyGmETtApHPuAYcm0Q_1Q.jpg\" max-width: 100%; width: 101px; height: 106px;\" width=\"101\" height=\"106\"></span></strong></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 1em; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><br></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">土生土长的巴黎人&nbsp;</span>Pierre Lefeuvre（又名Saycet）</span></strong><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">，便是在这样一个文化氛围浓厚、时尚与创意层出不穷的环境里成长。跟同龄孩子不一样的是，</span>Pierre&nbsp;<span margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">在</span>15岁的时候，深深的迷上了电子音乐，特别是高科技舞曲、浩室这类在当时还很小众、地下的电子音乐。</span><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线;\">巴黎这座城市的优雅，静谧，宽厚，也成了这位少年后来创作的电子音乐中最重要的元素。</span></strong></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span></strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">有过吉他专业训练素养的他，最后毅然决定放弃成为一名吉他手。后来他苦心自学键盘，并在大学里主修声音工程。毕业后曾在蓬皮杜艺术中心担任首席音响工程师，目前他的主要工作是为法国最大的一家商业广告公司制作音乐。当然，他最为人熟知的身份是氛围电子音乐项目 Saycet 的制作人兼主创。</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"></span></p><p margin-top:5px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:0;text-indent:0\"><span font-family: 等线;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 12px\"></span></p><p margin-top:5px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:0;text-indent:0\"><span font-family: 等线;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 12px\"></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">Saycet深受后摇乐团 Explosions in the Sky&nbsp;、盯鞋迷幻乐团&nbsp;Slowdive、Trip-hop 大神&nbsp;Massive Attack、以及合成器大师&nbsp;Brian Eno、极简音乐鼻祖 Steve Reich 的影响巨大，甚至他的作品会被一部分乐迷归纳到后摇的范畴里。许多深度后摇乐迷，对他的音乐相当痴迷，即便没有吉他重复的段落，震撼人心的鼓组。但各式电子合成器之间的完美结合，让 Saycet 的音乐跟墨西哥后摇乐团 Childs 有着异曲同工之妙——</span></strong><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">纯真</span></strong></span><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">。</span></strong></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">2006年，他在自己的音乐厂牌 Météores-Music 发行了处女作《One Day At Home》。</span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><br></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span></p><blockquote margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; border-left-width: 3px; border-left-color: rgb(219, 219, 219); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">细腻的鼓机切片，冷艳迷幻的气氛，再加上轻描淡写的主唱声线，三者浑然一体，整体感极佳</span></strong></p></blockquote><blockquote margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; border-left-width: 3px; border-left-color: rgb(219, 219, 219); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px;\">Saycet的迷幻电子音乐弥漫着梦幻般朦胧迷离的氛围景致，用动听的音色<br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span></strong></p></blockquote><blockquote margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; border-left-width: 3px; border-left-color: rgb(219, 219, 219); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">把科技实验感的冰冷沉重变调出浪漫的律动，生动唤醒了类似于回忆或梦境的场景</span></strong><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></p></blockquote><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">这张唱片也被多家音乐媒体评为当年梦幻轻柔类电子氛围音乐的重要佳作。</span><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px;\">在处子之作得到广泛好评之后，Saycet 于2010年发行了第二张全长专辑《Through The Window》。</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal; text-align: center;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201808/FrsJG9KpEKUbjmwE5hDn9xH8Qlwn.jpg\" max-width:100%\"></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><br></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">Pierre&nbsp;一如既往的延续了他的高水平的创作，亚裔音乐家 Phoene Somsavath 的加入，为这张专辑带来了更多精致的呈现。Saycet 略带疏离的电子采样，却营造了一种轻松的温暖。</span><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">华尔兹的旋律，层次分明的合成器音效，以及律动合拍的电子鼓机，让听众在他的音乐中捕捉到了一幅幅抽象的风景，聆听了一个个动人的童话故事。</strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">这位最初只想让外婆喜欢上自己创作的音乐的宅男，肯定想不到，在短短的几年里，在不远万里的中国竟然拥有一批忠实的听众，并且在世界范围内都积累了不少的支持者。2011年 Pierre 展开了第一轮世界巡演，足迹遍布了欧洲还有亚洲，并且在中国多个城市举办了专场。<strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">梦幻迷离、优雅浪漫的电子音乐现场，至今仍被乐迷们津津乐道。</strong></span></p><p margin-top:5px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:0;text-indent:0\"><span font-family: 等线;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 12px\"></span></p><p margin-top:5px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:0;text-indent:0\"><span font-family: 等线;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 12px\"></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">2015年 Saycet 再次推出爆款专辑《Mirage》，这也是一份心灵漫游的产物。<strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">乐队在欧美、俄罗斯、亚洲的巡演旅行中寻找灵感，沿途城市、建筑、设计、河畔，都成为棱镜，折射的色彩螺旋般积累上升。</strong></span><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">最终在电子合成器、声乐、小提琴、键盘的声音中，融汇幻梦与现实，成为迷醉半梦间独一无二的幻景。Phoene 缥缈、优柔的吟唱，弥散一缕神秘风情，Pierre 本人也为专辑献声，专辑封面渗透着浓浓的禅意：圆满透彻的内心。&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">暌违两年，这位巴黎梦幻电音王子将再次带着他还未发表的新作品展开新一轮的巡演，并为接下来的专辑创作寻找新的灵感。</span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span></p><blockquote margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; border-left-width: 3px; border-left-color: rgb(219, 219, 219); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">他的现场拥有独一无二的魅力，像极富感性的千面视听空间，</span><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px;\">飘渺，惬意，灵动……</span></strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">注重光与音，声与影，制作者将人声、素材、配器设计出精巧层次</span></strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 等线; letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px;\">配合专业VJ美轮美奂的灯光，催眠或释放感官</span></strong></span></p></blockquote><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">这种造梦的音乐在白天听着也会惹人神思涣散，在现场聆听会让肉体和灵魂随着音符飘然不知所踪。</strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal; text-align: center;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201808/FnnGPR7UWxsjSQzKf8lznjszTyG_.jpg\" max-width:100%\"></strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(123, 12, 0);\"><strong margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></strong></span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px;\">而今次，经过三年时间的磨砺，Saycet 的现场相比以往将更加的出色与前卫。</span></p><p margin: 0px 8px; padding: 0px; clear: both; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: 等线; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0px;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></span></p><blockquote margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; border-left-width: 3px; border-left-color: rgb(219, 219, 219); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,