nt-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">漆黑</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">夜里</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，便利店</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">是</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">唯一</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的选择</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。</span></span></p><p margin-top: 10px; line-height: normal;\"><br></p><p margin-top: 10px; line-height: normal;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">顺着静谧</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的墙边，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">我</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">俩一前一后，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">步伐似乎</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">比平日慢了几拍</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。对方似乎</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">有话想说却又不知如何开口。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">不知怎地</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，心跳</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">突然</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">砰砰砰</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">快了几拍</span></span><spa