adding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px; white-space: normal; widows: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></figure><p><br></p><p maxlength=\"1500\" data-reactid=\".1o4yp40smbk.5.0.2.$key_Poi_9ee97-567b771d690b22=147582385.$key_MediaWords_undefined.0\" margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">作为世界十大音乐节之一音乐节，每年<span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; font-family: 'times new roman';\">7</span>月下旬举办的日本富士摇滚音乐节与在东京举办的S<span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; font-family: 'times new roman';\">ummer Sonic</span>有着巨大的不同，后者的场地大部分在室内，而富士音乐节的举办场地则位于新泻苗场滑雪场，就卡司来说</span><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">，富士音乐节有超过<span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; font-family: 'times new roman';\">200</span>组艺人，是亚洲最大的音乐节，因大部分来自欧美，所以吸引了众多欧美乐迷前来朝圣。</span></p><p maxlength=\"1500\" data-reactid=\".1o4yp40smbk.5.0.2.$key_Poi_9ee97-567b771d690b22=147582385.$key_MediaWords_undefined.0\" margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/library/201606/FilOWp3Ce153Iz34_11wRd8li2sJ.jpg\"></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto;\"><br></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto;\">富士音乐节的主办方是日高正博创建的</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: 'times new roman';\">SMASH</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto;\">公司，首次于</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: 'times new roman';\">1997</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto;\">年在富士山附近的天神滑雪场举办，因为地理位置不理想，从</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: 'times new roman';\">1999</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto;\">年开始搬到了新泻苗场滑雪场，但是“富士山”这个标志性的名字和</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: 'times new roman';\">LOGO</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto;\">还是沿用至今。在东京上野站乘坐</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: 'times new roman';\">2</span><span font-size: 14px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto;\">个小时左右的新干线到达越后汤泽站，挂满音乐节旗帜的浓厚气氛令人兴奋，身边的所有人都全副武装赶去赴一场音乐盛会。</span></p><p maxlength=\"1500\" data-reactid=\".1o4yp40smbk.5.0.2.$key_Poi_9ee97-567b771d6b17c3=194906526.$key_MediaWords_undefined.0\" margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p maxlength=\"1500\" data-reactid=\".1o4yp40smbk.5.0.2.$key_Poi_9ee97-567b771d6b17c3=194906526.$key_MediaWords_undefined.0\" margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; line-height: 25.6px; widows: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">接着乘坐免费专车接送去音乐节场地，那里将是与东京完全不同的群山风景，冬天那里是滑雪的圣地，而到了夏天则是音乐的天堂，音乐节的各个舞台就散落于森林中。</span></p><p maxlength=\"1500\" data-reactid=\".1o4yp40smbk.5.0.2.$key_Poi_9ee97-567b771d6b17c3=194906526.$key_MediaWords_undefined.0\" margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; pad