55,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">在滚圈摸爬滚打了五十年的</span>Alice Cooper<span font-family:华文中宋\">，以惊悚、恐怖的舞台风格为人称道，甚至被乐迷和同行一致认为是</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">“</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">休克摇滚之父</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">”</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">。新专《</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Paranormal</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">》距离上一张录音室专辑《</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Welcome 2 My Nightmare</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">》已经过去了整整六年，也是自</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">2011</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">年入驻摇滚名人堂之后发布的第一张全长大碟。</span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><br></span></span></p><p margin: 0px; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%; text-align: center;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201707/FhGcaIApgVY1WnGzaoBaAjyXKOxb.jpg\" max-width:100%\"><br></span></span></p><p margin: 0px; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><br></span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"></span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">十首新歌的制作团队除了自己长期的工作伙伴</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Bob Ezrin</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">之外，还有一众好友的加盟，</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">ZZ Top</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">的吉他手</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Billy Gibbons</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">、</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">U2</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">的鼓手</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Larry Mullen</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">、</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Deep Purple</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">的贝斯手</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Roger Glover</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">等。</span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><br></span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><br></span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></p><section class=\"color1\" margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0.5em; height: 1.8em; min-width: 1em; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 1.125em; vertical-align: bottom; line-height: 1.8em; text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline-block;\"><p class=\"wihudong\" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><strong><span font-family: times new roman;\">09</span></strong></p></section><section margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0.8em 0px 0.5em; height: 1.8em; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8em; font-size: 1.125em; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block;\"><p margin: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><span color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><strong><span font-family: times new roman;\">Arcade Fire - Everything Now</span></strong></span></p></section><p><br></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p margin: 0px; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%; text-align: center;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201707/FpsUKCW0roesf4RmriUjqOogJ_hv.jpg\" max-width:100%\"></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px\"><span color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\"><span font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%; font-size: 12px;\"><span letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%; font-family: 华文中宋;\">（</span>7.28<span letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%; font-family: 华文中宋;\">）</span></span></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\">Arcade Fire<span font-family:华文中宋\">，</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">2001</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">年组建于加拿大蒙特利尔市，是一支备受独立乐迷青睐的独立、艺术摇滚乐队。</span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">自</span>2003<span font-family:华文中宋\">年发行第一张同名</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">EP</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">伊始，</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Arcade Fire</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">便占据着加拿大独立音乐场景中无可取代的重要一席。近乎每隔三年，他们就会交出一张新作，出道至今发行的四张录音室专辑都获得了格莱美最佳另类专辑的提名，参与的电影配乐也曾获得奥斯卡的入围肯定。</span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><br></span></span></p><p margin: 0px; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%; text-align: center;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201707/Fi1Au2qpXocuMyClQfy3bT_vHV4e.jpg\" max-width:100%\"><br></span></span></p><p text-align: center;\"> <br></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"></span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">6</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">月初释出的同名新单，不仅获得了业内挑剔乐评人的赞誉，也得到了乐迷积极的回馈，新专中的舞曲和电子元素相比之前的几张唱片都要重。当我还沉浸在上一张专辑《</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Reflektor</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">》的实验与迷幻之中时，他们又用新作俘获了我的耳朵。</span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><br></span></span></p><p margin: 0px; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%; text-align: center;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201707/FsCDtZ5zu8FdgGQ7y3Y-nCH07vp3.gif\" max-width:100%\"><br></span></span></p><p margin: 0px; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(63,63,63);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-siz