{"id":853,"title":"把妹纸都带到音乐节去撩吧","metaInfo":"言之・补梦人的狂想摇滚","cover":"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/FiKUpLhFrj2ApTy-Zz5b6X-Q-2tE.jpg","color":"#68605c","url":"http://www.luoo.net/essay/853","desc":"<p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/Fu0vvZjCqOkP_UEFSmjQfBK2jHaT.gif\" font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/Fouo-z5sh8BvRFqxiW8eOK201N8T.gif\" font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\">高司令主演的这部历时<span font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">6</span>年拍摄的音乐电影，终于可以让翘首以盼多年的影迷们，把伸长的脖子收回来了。<br></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\">看完这部片子之后，作为乐迷的我，必须得说，《歌声不绝》要比他后来拍摄的《爱乐之城》好看。</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"></span></p><p text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/FmtoXG_Dh09p5XcDVvOHzReY1dEG.gif\" \"></p><p text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/FozMXRuasdy35AZm4XqTORym9oyq.gif\" \"></p><p><br></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\">《歌声不绝》由美国泰斗级电影导演泰伦斯·马力克自编自导，这位在电影史上活跃了近半个世纪的导演，交出来的作品寥寥可数，但是部部都是佳作——</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/Fhbuwu5ougaEgFr3tgheWBvRRUXS.jpg\" \"></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 12px;\">天堂之日</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/Fsc5_rlqD6iHFh8LDKn2XNCuhuhe.jpg\" color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal;\"></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 12px;\">细细的红线</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 12px;\"><br></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/FukM9IkrkQgmmCUAnKV0zeGf5zIj.jpg\" white-space: normal;\"></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 12px;\">生命之树</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\">相比以往的几部片子，《歌声不绝》的卡司阵容，堪称非常强大。有目前正炙手可热的男星瑞恩·高斯林、人气爆棚的女演员鲁妮·玛拉、娜塔莉·波特曼、凯特·布兰切特以及深得文艺青年喜爱的迈克尔·法斯宾德。</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"></span></p><p text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/Fo0C2tK3WALsdSfJi-QSJC5D2JY6.gif\" \"></p><p text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/FkTzizD-LKL9fzHf9eXJSNPrTjJI.gif\" \"></p><p><br></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\">这部拍摄周期长达<span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">6</span>年的作品，讲述一段围绕在<span font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">3</span>个音乐人之间的爱情关系。他们在追求摇滚、成名的路上，却也经历了背叛与诱惑。</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\">性，作为诱惑，也作为一种道德和精神危机，将这种主要的异性恋故事与同性恋意识联系起来。</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/Fk72j4w5nHz_G1XBAYosRjMHR9jn.gif\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/FpHG0NDvJyc6ahJmsalBzN85F80M.gif\"></p><p text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;\">抽离掉最基本的爱情故事，导演用镜头完美地呈现了这个世界现场音乐之都——德克萨斯当下的地下音乐场景。</span></p><p margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &q