ttom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px\"></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">朱莉</span>·<span font-family:华文中宋\">克鲁兹</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(136,136,136);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">（</span>Julee Cruise<span font-family:华文中宋\">）</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">绝对是一个你在主流音乐媒体上看不到的名字，但是这个名字却常常跟大卫</span>·<span font-family:华文中宋\">林奇联系在一起。当时，林奇作词，巴德拉门蒂作曲为电影《蓝丝绒》创作了一首歌《</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Mysteries of Love</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">》。可是，一直找不到合适的歌手来演唱，直到巴德拉门蒂推荐了在剧场表演的朱莉</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">·</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">克鲁兹。</span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px\"><br></span></p><p margin: 0px; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255) none repeat scroll 0% 0%; text-align: center;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/FjCCl0zaO6b9GtVA9Q6t9srglZi5.gif\"></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\">&nbsp;</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(136,136,136);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">《双峰》第一季</span></span></p><p text-align: center;\"> <span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px\"></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">朱莉</span>·<span font-family:华文中宋\">克鲁兹梦幻、缥缈、空灵的声音立马抓住了林奇的耳朵。她的嗓音甚至能跟当时红极一时的梦幻流行乐团</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">This Mortal Coil</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">、</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Cocteau Twins</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">的主唱相媲美。也因为这段缘分，电影拍摄完之后，林奇与巴德拉门蒂继续为克鲁兹创作了一些歌曲，并且帮助她发行了第一张专辑《</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Floating into the Night</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">》。</span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><br></span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/pics/essays/201706/FuqJMvM72z3ptmu_o64kpQ3bqZ7F.gif\"></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(136,136,136);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">《双峰》第二季</span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:left;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">一直到第三季，《双峰》每集都以克鲁兹那首标志性的歌《</span>Falling<span font-family:华文中宋\">》拉开序幕。甚至在第一季第一集即将结束的时候，克鲁兹在路屋酒吧现场表演了这首歌。台上的乐队淡定自若地表演着，而当时的台下一片混乱，各自因劳拉之死，心怀对彼此的怨恨。</span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:left;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"><br></span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:left;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"></span></span></p><p margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;background:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(62,62,62);letter-spacing:0;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;backg