华文中宋\">更加亲密无间的了解到最本土</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">最</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">真实的英国文化。</span></span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">lur<span font-family:华文中宋\">作为</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">rit-Pop<span font-family:华文中宋\">四巨头之一，大概是最有幽默感的一支乐队</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，也是对</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">英国人生活本质探讨</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">相当</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">多的一支乐队，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">他们的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">音乐</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">聚焦于</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">英国中产阶级小人物的普通日常，物质</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">生活</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">与精神</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">生活</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的冲突，现代生活的无趣乏味，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">城市</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的冰冷</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">人的孤独无助</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">与</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">空洞。在</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">lur<span font-family:华文中宋\">最</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">标志性</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">rit-Pop<span font-family:华文中宋\">三张专辑</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">中</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">：《<span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">M</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">odern Life Is Rubbish</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"></span></span>》《<span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">Parklife</span>》</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">《<span font-family:Times New Roman\"><span color:#595959\">The Great Escape</span></span><span font-family:华文中宋\"></span>》</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">，这些</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">随处可见</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。带有黑色幽默</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">特点的记叙性歌词</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">与</span>D</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">amon Albarn<span font-family:华文中宋\">从不改变的吊儿郎当</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">唱腔，相得益彰，使歌中所描绘的英国生活显得</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">滑稽又可悲</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。</span></span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/library/201609/FpQp0an_s_2JAf1gb2Cj6o4sjsoJ.jpg\"></span></p><p line-height: 150%;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">之所以把</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">lur<span font-family:华文中宋\">描述为深刻的，是因为在他们的</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">Brit-Pop</span><span font-family:华文中宋\">特色中，占主要地位的是他们对物质生活下行尸走肉</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">般</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">都市人</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">物的描述</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">和思考</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。这种</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">思考，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">与</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">那个香蕉鱼的故事是如此的如出一辙，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">而</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">这种思考在</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">今日的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">中国</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">也</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">非常适用，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">实际上</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">社会稳定</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">生活富足之后，每一</span></span><span ;font-family:华文中宋;color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">种</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">体制</span></span><span ;font-family:华文中宋;color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">中</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，人们在物质生活面前都同</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">样</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">空洞</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">无力</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">lur<span font-family:华文中宋\">以他们的音乐形式去感染</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">人们</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">并呼唤人们思考</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">其实摇滚乐</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">到底是什么</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">？</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">也许</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">摇滚乐就是</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">不断地</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">质问和</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">不断地</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">回答。</span></span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">在</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">这三张专辑中，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">他们描述了各色人物、</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">英国人的日常休闲时光</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">、</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">挣扎于物欲生活和冰冷城市间的爱情</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">、还有</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">英</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">美</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">文化的交融和冲突，所有</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">这</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">一切都可以</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">称</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">为英国人的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">文化现象</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">是</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">最平常真实的英国，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">从这种意义上，或许可以说</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">这是最纯</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">正</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">rit-Pop</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。</span>B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">lur<span font-family:华文中宋\">把这些现象交付给世人去看，带</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">着</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">嘲讽，带</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">着</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">同情，带着</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">黑色幽默</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，还带着一丝</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">忧伤</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">这便是属于</span>B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">lur<span font-family:华文中宋\">的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">rit-Pop<span font-family:华文中宋\">表现形式。</span></span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">在</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">《<span font-family:Times New Roman\"><span color:#595959\">The Great Escape</span></span><span font-family:华文中宋\"></span>》</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">之后</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">他们开始在音乐风格上尝试大的变动</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">：在</span>1997<span font-family:华文中宋\">年</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">发行的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">lur</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">中</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">他们尝试</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">吸收</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">美国</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">独立摇滚乐</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的元素，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">低保真</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">及</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">零星的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">噪声</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">被</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">加到专辑中</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">使</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">专辑呈现出一种粗糙质感</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">听觉效果</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">听上去有了</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">美式</span>G</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">runge<span font-family:华文中宋\">摇滚</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">感觉</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。而后来</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">在</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">1999<span font-family:华文中宋\">年</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">发行的《<span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">13<span font-family:华文中宋\"></span></span>》</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">则</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">开始尝试电子及实验风格，这种风格一直延续到了</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">于</span>2002<span font-family:华文中宋\">年</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">发行的《<span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">T</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">hink Tank</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"></span></span>》</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">奇妙的是这些</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">不同</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">风格</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">尝试及</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">其他元素</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的添加，并没有阻止他们继续作为一只优秀乐队活跃在人们眼中，甚至相反，可以说他们转变的相当成功，他们的音乐并没有因为跳出</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">了</span>B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">rit-Pop<span font-family:华文中宋\">的限制</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">而</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">受到太大影响</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">：</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">一度创造了</span><em>Song</em>2</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">这样的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">金</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">曲</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">以及</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">13<span font-family:华文中宋\">这样</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">优秀的实验</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">、</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">电子专辑。</span></span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"http://img-cdn2.luoo.net/library/201609/Fu2o5MXEy67MsPJ0xeSJBp6c13dO.jpg\"></span></p><p line-height: 150%;\"><br></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">他们</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">音乐总不</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">会</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">遭到太坏的评价。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">也正是从</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">乐队转向实验、电子的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">方向开始</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">乐队主唱</span>D</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">amon Albarn<span font-family:华文中宋\">开始</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">在电子乐</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">及实验</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">音乐</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">方面做出了更大的尝试，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">他</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">发行了自己的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">solo</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">专辑也组建了</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">Gorillaz</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">同样</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，这些</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">尝试也</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">都获得了成功</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。而</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">此时</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，在乐队发行了</span>13</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">之后</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，吉他手</span>G</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">raham </span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">C</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">oxon</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">也</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">于离开了乐队，开始尝试自己的单飞音乐生涯。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">短暂</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">的分道扬镳后，在</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">2008<span font-family:华文中宋\">年</span><span font-family:Times New Roman\">B</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">lur</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">重组</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">了，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">他们</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">在</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">此</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">期间进行了巡演，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">并</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">在</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">2010<span font-family:华文中宋\">年</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">发行了</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">回归</span>B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">rit-Pop<span font-family:华文中宋\">风格单曲</span></span><em><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">F</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">ool‘s Day</span></em><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，然后</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">于</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">2015</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">年</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">发行了他们的第</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">8<span font-family:华文中宋\">张</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">录音室专辑：《<span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">T</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">he Magic Whip</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\"></span></span>》。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">在某种程度上</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，这是一张让中国乐迷特别感到欣喜的专辑，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">专辑</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">中可以听到</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">lur<span font-family:华文中宋\">的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">B</span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\">rit-Pop<span font-family:华文中宋\">特色延续，也可以听到他们在电子乐及实验音乐方面的延续，还有一些有趣的与之前作品完全不同的特色和创新。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">另外这张</span></span><span ;font-fam