or:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">他们</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">便</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">教会了自鸣得意沉溺满足于现代物质生活的人们</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">如何去</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">反思自己</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">思考</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">自身</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">存在的价值</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">。</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">真正</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">宝贵的</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">是音乐所传递的精神本质，</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">真正</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">宝贵的是能注入</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">人们</span></span><span ;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(89,89,89);font-size:14px\"><span font-family:华文中宋\">灵魂的东西。</span></span></p><p ;line-height: 150%\"><span ;font-fam